  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let the mass of the bullet be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and mass of the block be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>. It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. By conservation of momentum,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>v</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>v</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>The force acting on the block&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>g</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>g</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><msup><mo>&#39;</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>S</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>100</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
